{% block body %}
     <main class="professional-loan">
     <section class="hero-section hero-immobilier text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-center">
    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold">Mortgage Loan</h1>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Make your property dream come true. We find the best mortgage loan tailored to your project.</p>
        <a href="#details" class="btn btn-primary-custom btn-lg mt-4">Learn more</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="introduction" class="py-5 bg-light-blue">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12 text-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-4">Understanding Mortgage Loans</h2>
                <p class="lead text-secondary-dark">
                    Acquiring a property, whether it is your primary residence, a rental investment, or land, often represents one of the most important projects in life. To make this dream come true, appropriate <strong>financing</strong> is key. At <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong>, we put our expertise at your service to help you navigate the complex world of <strong>mortgage loans</strong>, offering personalized solutions that perfectly match your situation and property goals.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="details" class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row mb-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="200">
            <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12 mx-auto">
