                <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                    A <strong>Mortgage Loan</strong> is a loan intended to finance the purchase, construction, or renovation of real estate (house, apartment, land). It is generally characterized by significant amounts and long repayment periods. This type of loan comes with specific conditions (interest rate, guarantees, borrower's insurance) that must be adapted to your financial profile and the nature of your project to ensure its viability and your peace of mind.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row align-items-center mb-5 feature-row" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="1000">
